'=>'安装 webhook','Create the key in Stripe'=>'在 Stripe 中创建密钥','I want to set it up in Stripe myself'=>'我想在 Stripe 中自己设置','Create an endpoint in Stripe with this URL:'=>'使用以下 URL 在 Stripe 中创建端点：','Select the %d events listed in our documentation, then paste that endpoint signing secret:'=>'选择我们文档中列出的 %d 个事件，然后粘贴该端点签名密钥：','Signing secret'=>'签名密钥','Save'=>'保存','Add a Stripe secret key for this mode first.'=>'请先为此模式添加一个 Stripe 秘密密钥。','Stripe cannot reach a local address. Forward events with Stripe CLI to %s'=>'Stripe 无法访问本地地址。通过 Stripe CLI 将事件转发到 %s','Some events are missing, so parts of your store will not update.'=>'一些事件缺失，因此您的商店的部分内容将无法更新。','This account does not let us re-check the endpoint, so no live status is shown.'=>'该帐户不允许我们重新检查端点，因此不显示实时状态。','Webhook check failed: %s'=>'Webhook 检查失败：%s','You are not allowed to configure Stripe webhooks.'=>'您不允许配置 Stripe webhooks。','That key does not look like a Stripe key for the selected mode. Copy a restricted key that starts with rk_, or a secret key that starts with sk_.'=>'该密钥看起来不像所选模式的 Stripe 密钥。复制一个以 rk_ 开头的受限密钥，或一个以 sk_ 开头的秘密密钥。','Webhook is active and the signing secret is saved. The key you pasted was not stored, so you can delete it in Stripe now.'=>'Webhook 已激活，签名密钥已保存。您粘贴的密钥未被存储，因此您现在可以在 Stripe 中删除它。','Webhook events were updated. The key you pasted was not stored, so you can delete it in Stripe now.'=>'Webhook 事件已更新。您粘贴的密钥未被存储，因此您现在可以在 Stripe 中删除它。','That webhook endpoint already existed, so Stripe did not return a signing secret. Open the endpoint in your Stripe Dashboard, copy the signing secret, and paste it below.'=>'该 webhook 端点已经存在，因此 Stripe 没有返回签名密钥。请在您的 Stripe 控制面板中打开该端点，复制签名密钥，然后粘贴到下面。','A Stripe signing secret starts with whsec_. Copy it again from the webhook endpoint in your Stripe Dashboard.'=>'Stripe 签名密钥以 whsec_ 开头。请再次从您的 Stripe 控制面板中的 webhook 端点复制它。','Signing secret saved. Send a test event from Stripe to confirm that your site accepts it.'=>'签名密钥已保存。请从 Stripe 发送测试事件以确认您的网站可以接受它。','Paste a Stripe 